Hi <%= @user.short_name %>,

Someone requested a password reset for your<%= @account ? " #{@account.name}" : "" %> account. If this was
you, set a new password here - this link expires in 15 minutes:

<%= edit_password_url(@user.generate_token_for(:password_reset)) %>

If you didn't request this, you can safely ignore this email - your password won't change
unless you visit the link above and set a new one.
